{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "KJV1769",
  "book_code": "ROM",
  "chapter": 3,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "What advantage then hath the Jew? or what profit ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is there",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of circumcision?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Much every way: chiefly, because that unto them were committed the oracles of God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For what if some did not believe? shall their unbelief make the faith of God without effect?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "God forbid: yea, let God be true, but every man a liar; as it is written, That thou mightest be justified in thy sayings, and mightest overcome when thou art judged.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But if our unrighteousness commend the righteousness of God, what shall we say? ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " God unrighteous who taketh vengeance? (I speak as a man)",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "God forbid: for then how shall God judge the world?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For if the truth of God hath more abounded through my lie unto his glory; why yet am I also judged as a sinner?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And not ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "rather",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", (as we be slanderously reported, and as some affirm that we say,) Let us do evil, that good may come? whose damnation is just.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "What then? are we better ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "than they",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "? No, in no wise: for we have before proved both Jews and Gentiles, that they are all under sin;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As it is written, There is none righteous, no, not one:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There is none that understandeth, there is none that seeketh after God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They are all gone out of the way, they are together become unprofitable; there is none that doeth good, no, not one.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Their throat ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an open sepulchre; with their tongues they have used deceit; the poison of asps ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " under their lips:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whose mouth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " full of cursing and bitterness:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Their feet ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " swift to shed blood:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Destruction and misery ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in their ways:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the way of peace have they not known:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There is no fear of God before their eyes.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now we know that what things soever the law saith, it saith to them who are under the law: that every mouth may be stopped, and all the world may become guilty before God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore by the deeds of the law there shall no flesh be justified in his sight: for by the law ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the knowledge of sin.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But now the righteousness of God without the law is manifested, being witnessed by the law and the prophets;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Even the righteousness of God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "which is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " by faith of Jesus Christ unto all and upon all them that believe: for there is no difference:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For all have sinned, and come short of the glory of God;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Being justified freely by his grace through the redemption that is in Christ Jesus:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whom God hath set forth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a propitiation through faith in his blood, to declare his righteousness for the remission of sins that are past, through the forbearance of God;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To declare, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "I say",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", at this time his righteousness: that he might be just, and the justifier of him which believeth in Jesus.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Where ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " boasting then? It is excluded. By what law? of works? Nay: but by the law of faith.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore we conclude that a man is justified by faith without the deeds of the law.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Is he",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the God of the Jews only? ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is he",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not also of the Gentiles? Yes, of the Gentiles also:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Seeing ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " one God, which shall justify the circumcision by faith, and uncircumcision through faith.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.3.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:ROM.3.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Do we then make void the law through faith? God forbid: yea, we establish the law.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
